 "_README": [
  "Contestable registry for entity resolution: who a claim is ABOUT.",
  "",
  "orgs          canonical name -> surface forms found in headlines and publisher tags.",
  "products      product or model name -> the organisation that ships it.",
  "site_org      domain -> the organisation whose own site it is. Used only when the",
  "              headline names no other organisation.",
  "",
  "⛔ EMPTY IS A VALID ANSWER AND A COMMON ONE. A piece about a labour market, a lawsuit",
  "trend or a research field has no subject organisation. Forcing one produced 'Artists',",
  "'AI startups', 'Researchers' and 'None' on 2026-07-31. Publisher tagging agrees: the",
  "TechCrunch forward-deployed-engineers piece is tagged 'AI talent wars, FDE' with no",
  "company in it. When nothing resolves, leave the entity blank. Source class remains a",
  "separate field and no claim tier is guessed."
